OL,3,GNEWSAMicrosoft scrambles to solve
OL,4,Aglobal outage affecting Outlook and
OL,5,ATeams but says fixes not going 'as
OL,6,Aexpected'
OL,7,
OL,8,FA Microsoft outage is continuing to
OL,9,Faffect services including Teams,
OL,10,FOutlook and AI software Copilot -
OL,11,Fhere's what we know
OL,13,FThe outage started on Thursday, with
OL,14,Fmonitoring website Downdetector seeing
OL,15,Fissues reported in more than 70
OL,16,Fcountries
OL,18,FReports about Outlook alone peaked
OL,19,Fglobally at about 140,000, according to
OL,20,FDowndetector. This has gone down to
OL,21,Fabout 43,000 now, though the number of
OL,22,Fpeople affected is likely higher
OL,23,APub: 13-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/3
OL,24,ANext PageB  Scot NewsC Reg TVF  Weather
FL,423,420,260,160,0,100
