OL,3,GNEWSAMicrosoft scrambles to solve
OL,4,Aglobal outage affecting Outlook and
OL,5,ATeams but says fixes not going 'as
OL,6,Aexpected'
OL,7,
OL,8,FMicrosoft says its attempts to fix the
OL,9,Fissue are not "taking as expected",
OL,10,Fadding that the issue hasn't been
OL,11,Fcaused by a cyber-security breach
OL,13,FMore than 430 million people use
OL,14,FMicrosoft 365 apps, and tech giants
OL,15,FOpenAI and Anthropic have reported
OL,16,Fproblems as a result of the outage
OL,23,APub: 13-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/3
