OL,3,GNEWSAMicrosoft scrambles to solve
OL,4,Aglobal outage affecting Outlook and
OL,5,ATeams but says fixes not going 'as
OL,6,Aexpected'
OL,7,
OL,8,FIn India, an executive at a brokerage
OL,9,Ffirm explains the "challenge" of trying
OL,10,Fto contact clients; Japan's government
OL,11,Fsays its shared IT platform is
OL,12,Fdisrupted; Australia's spy and federal
OL,13,Fpolice agencies also report issues -
OL,14,Fbut say it's "very much" email-related
